      "text": "thou shalt smite the rock, and there shall come water out of it, Ex. 17:6 (Num. 20:11; Deut. 8:15; 1 Ne. 17:29; 20:21; 2 Ne. 25:20). He brought streams also out of the rock, Ps. 78:16. He opened the rock, and the waters gushed out, Ps. 105:41. he shall be … for a rock of offence, Isa. 8:14 (Rom. 9:33; 1 Pet. 2:8; 2 Ne. 18:14). I will lay thy stones … and lay thy foundations, Isa. 54:11. a hammer that breaketh the rock in pieces, Jer. 23:29. stone was cut out without hands, Dan. 2:34 (D&C 65:2).",
